8. Users shall be able to view the details of any book by clicking the View button next to each book in the list on the My Books Page.
9. Users shall be able to see the title, author, and content of a selected book on the Book Details Page.
10. Users shall be able to navigate back to the My Books Page from the Book Details Page.
11. Users shall be able to view the About Page for information about the application, its version, and contact details for support.
